{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender makesrna Module.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender makesrna Module.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender makesrna module blender makesrna module","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender makesrna Module.md","fileName":"Blender makesrna Module.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender makesrna Module","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender RNA Data Architecture]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender RNA Data Architecture","Blender RNA Definition API","Blender RNA Generated Source","Blender RNA System","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender makesrna Module.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender makesrna Module.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender makesrna module blender makesrna module","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender makesrna Module.md","fileName":"Blender makesrna Module.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender makesrna Module","heading":"Blender makesrna Module","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The `makesrna` module defines and generates the infrastructure behind Blender RNA and the Data API. Unlike an ordinary runtime-only module, it contains code compiled into a generator as well as code compiled into the final Blender executable.\n\nIts [[Blender RNA Definition API]] describes wrappers for DNA types, while its build-time process writes [[Blender RNA Generated Source]]. The final runtime combines generated accessors with repository implementations so the [[Blender RNA System]] can expose data to operators, interface code, and Python.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender RNA Data Architecture","Blender RNA Definition API","Blender RNA Generated Source","Blender RNA System","coreblenderdevelop